  "summary": "High-resale items that ship in poly mailers or small boxes. Curated to fit the user's preference: NO power tools, NO mid-size kitchen appliances, NO large furniture. Sweet spot is items under 5 lbs with $50-500 resale value — vintage lanterns, premium pocket knives, multi-tools, vintage radios, motorcycle helmets, premium drinkware, smart chargers, metal detectors, and protective cases. These are the items hiding in mixed shop-cleanout / estate auctions that the previous BOLO files (clothing/computer/auto/etc.) didn't capture.",
  "field_workflow": [
    "Always weigh before listing — anything over 5 lbs needs medium_box freight, kills margin on items under $100",
    "Vintage lantern condition: globe (intact, no cracks), pump (rebuildable), generator tube (replaceable)",
    "Pocket knife: confirm blade isn't bent, lock function works, original box adds 30%+",
    "Multi-tool: all blades / pliers / screwdrivers function smoothly",
    "Vintage radio: power-on test if possible; faceplate condition + tube glow visible",
    "Helmet: DOT/SNELL sticker intact, liner not torn, retention strap functions",
    "Pelican case: foam intact, latches working, hinge pins present",
    "Original packaging on knives + multi-tools = +25-40% over loose"
  ],
  "skip_list": [
    "Cracked lantern globe (replacement globes available but mostly not worth it)",
    "Damaged knife blade (bent / chipped / pitted)",
    "Helmet with cracks / impact damage (DOT-compliant resale impossible)",
    "Pelican case with missing foam",
    "Generic camping lantern (battery-powered modern)",
    "Walmart-tier multi-tool",
    "Cracked radio cabinet",
    "Untested electronics (broad caveat — disclose if you don't test)"
  ],
